# Kanban Board – AI Tools Usage & Student Productivity Analyzer

## 1. Project Overview

The Kanban Board is used to plan, organize, track, and manage the development of the **AI Tools Usage & Student Productivity Analyzer** project. It follows the principles of Agile project management by dividing the project into smaller tasks and tracking their progress visually.

The project analyzes student survey data to understand AI tool usage and its relationship with student productivity and academic performance. The dashboard is developed using Python, Pandas, and Streamlit.

## 2. Objectives

- Organize project tasks systematically.
- Track the progress of development and testing.
- Identify pending tasks and potential issues.
- Improve task visibility and workflow management.
- Maintain project documentation.
- Track continuous integration activities using GitHub Actions.

